    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN INTROVERT'S EXPERIENCE IN AN EXTROVERTS' WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misgiven is an emotional 2D sci-fi adventure game about the lump in your throat and how difficult it can be to open up to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/d2d177683c24377d3d70620698e8b219.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/d2d177683c24377d3d70620698e8b219.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/d2d177683c24377d3d70620698e8b219.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Cassandra, a space adventurer stranded in a city of masks and unbreathable fog, you come across the mask of an explorer, whose role you'll have to play to stay alive and deliver a warning no one wants to hear. But how well can you pretend to be someone else, and how far will you go?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE THE WORLD THROUGH THE MASK OF A STRANGER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear Kasturi's mask and pretend you're her to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate her past, discover her social circle and find out what happened to her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on her role in order to save the city, or let the mask slip.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/184ad2ff93a80524675190e28df9e7e5.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/184ad2ff93a80524675190e28df9e7e5.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/184ad2ff93a80524675190e28df9e7e5.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WRESTLE WITH YOUR WORDS AND MAKE MEANINGFUL CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a lonely space explorer in an identity crisis, your social anxiety makes it difficult to open up to others.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue options - your thoughts - have different emotional weights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your openness to another person can change over time, and new topics can become available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe and stick to small-talk, or try to squeeze in difficult topics for a chance to connect deeply, and risk being misunderstood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/b7d517325ec1bc1e657345a345b53320.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/b7d517325ec1bc1e657345a345b53320.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/b7d517325ec1bc1e657345a345b53320.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A CITY SHROUDED IN MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stranded in the city of Koriol - a sprawling metropolis built on the rim of a giant crater, veiled in toxic fog.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in hazy, neon-lit streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange your mask's air filter to survive in the fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit rundown night clubs and floating temples.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to make this place your home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/89e009b7cbd9bba91c8fdaf96b118e88.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/89e009b7cbd9bba91c8fdaf96b118e88.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/89e009b7cbd9bba91c8fdaf96b118e88.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPRESS YOURSELF WITH HOLOGRAPHIC EMOTES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire an entire holographic emote inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convey a certain tone and change the course of the conversation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your connections and get access to people and places.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/c6f67f049e9b67125446e90992805df2.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/c6f67f049e9b67125446e90992805df2.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And flip off anyone who's earned it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/6c0ebff24a5ec401997b797cfda93d7c.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/6c0ebff24a5ec401997b797cfda93d7c.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/6c0ebff24a5ec401997b797cfda93d7c.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AN INTROVERT'S EXPERIENCE IN AN EXTROVERTS' WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Misgiven is an emotional 2D sci-fi adventure game about the lump in your throat and how difficult it can be to open up to others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/d2d177683c24377d3d70620698e8b219.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/d2d177683c24377d3d70620698e8b219.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/d2d177683c24377d3d70620698e8b219.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Cassandra, a space adventurer stranded in a city of masks and unbreathable fog, you come across the mask of an explorer, whose role you'll have to play to stay alive and deliver a warning no one wants to hear. But how well can you pretend to be someone else, and how far will you go?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIENCE THE WORLD THROUGH THE MASK OF A STRANGER</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wear Kasturi's mask and pretend you're her to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate her past, discover her social circle and find out what happened to her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on her role in order to save the city, or let the mask slip.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/184ad2ff93a80524675190e28df9e7e5.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/184ad2ff93a80524675190e28df9e7e5.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/184ad2ff93a80524675190e28df9e7e5.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WRESTLE WITH YOUR WORDS AND MAKE MEANINGFUL CHOICES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a lonely space explorer in an identity crisis, your social anxiety makes it difficult to open up to others.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dialogue options - your thoughts - have different emotional weights.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your openness to another person can change over time, and new topics can become available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it safe and stick to small-talk, or try to squeeze in difficult topics for a chance to connect deeply, and risk being misunderstood.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/b7d517325ec1bc1e657345a345b53320.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/b7d517325ec1bc1e657345a345b53320.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/b7d517325ec1bc1e657345a345b53320.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE A CITY SHROUDED IN MYSTERY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are stranded in the city of Koriol - a sprawling metropolis built on the rim of a giant crater, veiled in toxic fog.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get lost in hazy, neon-lit streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange your mask's air filter to survive in the fog.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Visit rundown night clubs and floating temples.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to make this place your home.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/89e009b7cbd9bba91c8fdaf96b118e88.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/89e009b7cbd9bba91c8fdaf96b118e88.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/89e009b7cbd9bba91c8fdaf96b118e88.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPRESS YOURSELF WITH HOLOGRAPHIC EMOTES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Acquire an entire holographic emote inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convey a certain tone and change the course of the conversation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your connections and get access to people and places.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/c6f67f049e9b67125446e90992805df2.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/c6f67f049e9b67125446e90992805df2.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And flip off anyone who's earned it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/6c0ebff24a5ec401997b797cfda93d7c.poster.avif?t=1754561503\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/6c0ebff24a5ec401997b797cfda93d7c.webm?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2475620/extras/6c0ebff24a5ec401997b797cfda93d7c.mp4?t=1754561503\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Misgiven is an emotional sci-fi adventure about the lump in your throat. Stranded in a city veiled in toxic fog, take on a stranger's mask to survive. Wrestle with your thoughts in a tangible dialogue system. Struggle to keep up the facade, or dare to drop it, to find allies as a harbinger of doom.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cThe mix of new ideas and tried and tested controls is convincing. The game captivates us with its gripping atmosphere and all-round professional presentation. The story elegantly transports current topics such as empathy, freedom, inequality, oppression and environmental destruction into a science fiction setting. Never have we looked forward to a toxic particulate matter tsunami as much as we do here.\u201d<br>The German Computer Games Award 2024<br>",
